      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight you feel is immense, and the idea of relief from this constant pressure is incredibly tempting. If the noise and the weight are becoming unbearable, please know that there is a way to stop the feeling of being trapped. You can reach out to the Crisis Text Line by texting HOME to 741741 for immediate, confidential support. They can offer a space where you don't have to carry this crushing burden alone.",
